{"id":"03fd31ede57cedbe","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-inductive-norm.md","title":"非单调累积归纳的入层范数","display":"df-inductive-norm — 非单调累积归纳的入层范数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-inductive-norm","aliases":["18-df-inductive-norm"],"display":"df-inductive-norm — 非单调累积归纳的入层范数","depends_on":["[[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"§13.1 inductive norm; Lemma 13.1.4","source_printed_pages":"334","source_pdf_pages":"342","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"已核 Lemma 13.1.4 的全部证明；使用上游阶段停滞的局部证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-inductive-norm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-inductive-norm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive-norm — 非单调累积归纳的入层范数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.1 inductive norm; Lemma 13.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"334"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"342"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"已核 Lemma 13.1.4 的全部证明；使用上游阶段停滞的局部证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^\\alpha\">\\(\\Gamma^\\alpha\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Gamma|\">\\(|\\Gamma|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma\">\\(P_\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma_\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_\\Gamma\">\\(\\nu_\\Gamma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_\\Gamma\">\\(r_\\Gamma\\)</span> 由下式引入，分别作为生成集、闭包序数、入层范数及其全域扩展的记号；不预先假定范数存在。扩展中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 是大于全部实际入层序数的指定哨兵值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\Omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma:=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty},\\qquad\\sigma_\\Gamma:=|\\Gamma|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_\\Gamma:=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty},\\qquad\\sigma_\\Gamma:=|\\Gamma|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu_\\Gamma:=\n\\{\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle\\in P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma_\\Gamma\\mid\nn\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;(n\\notin\\Gamma^\\beta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu_\\Gamma:=\n\\{\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle\\in P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma_\\Gamma\\mid\nn\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;(n\\notin\\Gamma^\\beta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu_\\Gamma\\in{}^{P_\\Gamma}\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\nu_\\Gamma)=\\sigma_\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu_\\Gamma\\in{}^{P_\\Gamma}\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\nu_\\Gamma)=\\sigma_\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_\\Gamma:\\omega\\to\\Omega+1,\\qquad\nr_\\Gamma(n):=\\begin{cases}\n\\nu_\\Gamma(n)&amp;n\\in P_\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Omega&amp;n\\notin P_\\Gamma.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_\\Gamma:\\omega\\to\\Omega+1,\\qquad\nr_\\Gamma(n):=\\begin{cases}\n\\nu_\\Gamma(n)&amp;n\\in P_\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Omega&amp;n\\notin P_\\Gamma.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\sigma_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{n\\in P_\\Gamma\\mid\\nu_\\Gamma(n)=\\alpha\\}\n=\\Gamma^\\alpha\\setminus\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\sigma_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{n\\in P_\\Gamma\\mid\\nu_\\Gamma(n)=\\alpha\\}\n=\\Gamma^\\alpha\\setminus\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书把未入层元素的范数写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>；此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 这一集合序数作明确哨兵，所以后续比较可以在总函数上进行，而实际范数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_\\Gamma\">\\(\\nu_\\Gamma\\)</span> 的值域仍是闭包序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Gamma|\">\\(|\\Gamma|\\)</span>。这不把未入层元素纳入范数的满射定义域。</p>\n<p>已读 Lemma 13.1.4 的陈述与全部证明。停滞引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma_\\Gamma}\">\\(P_\\Gamma=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma_\\Gamma}\\)</span>，故每个成员有唯一的最早入层序数，小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma_\\Gamma\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\sigma_\\Gamma\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\sigma_\\Gamma\\)</span>，该层尚未停滞，因此差集非空；其中每个元素的最早层恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>，证明满射性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_\\Gamma=0\">\\(\\sigma_\\Gamma=0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma=\\varnothing\">\\(P_\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\)</span>，范数为唯一空函数，仍满射到空序数。这同时检查了最小退化情形。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；$\\Gamma^\\alpha$、$\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}$、$|\\Gamma|$、$\\Gamma^{<\\infty}$ 取 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]。$P_\\Gamma$、$\\sigma_\\Gamma$、$\\nu_\\Gamma$ 与 $r_\\Gamma$ 由下式引入，分别作为生成集、闭包序数、入层范数及其全域扩展的记号；不预先假定范数存在。扩展中的 $\\Omega$ 是大于全部实际入层序数的指定哨兵值。$n\\in\\omega$，$\\alpha,\\beta<\\Omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Gamma|","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"r_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta<\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma:=\\Gamma^{<\\infty},\\qquad\\sigma_\\Gamma:=|\\Gamma|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu_\\Gamma:=\n\\{\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle\\in P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma_\\Gamma\\mid\nn\\in\\Gamma^\\alpha\\land\\forall\\beta<\\alpha\\;(n\\notin\\Gamma^\\beta)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu_\\Gamma\\in{}^{P_\\Gamma}\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\nu_\\Gamma)=\\sigma_\\Gamma.","display":true},{"tex":"r_\\Gamma:\\omega\\to\\Omega+1,\\qquad\nr_\\Gamma(n):=\\begin{cases}\n\\nu_\\Gamma(n)&n\\in P_\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Omega&n\\notin P_\\Gamma.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha<\\sigma_\\Gamma\\quad\n\\{n\\in P_\\Gamma\\mid\\nu_\\Gamma(n)=\\alpha\\}\n=\\Gamma^\\alpha\\setminus\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Gamma|","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma=\\Gamma^{<\\sigma_\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\sigma_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_\\Gamma=0","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2585,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-inductive-norm]]"},{"id":"267d66ca73221e94","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；阶段取 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]，$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]。$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2$ 是下式定义的非严格与严格阶段比较关系；$x\\preceq_\\Gamma y$、$x\\prec_\\Gamma y$ 为相应的中缀缩写。$x,y,z\\in\\omega$。集合论有序对 $\\langle x,y\\rangle$ 仅作为关系的元素，不是算术语言中的数码。"},{"id":"a2393ecde85db745","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$。$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]；$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-stage-comparison]]；$\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega$ 与 $\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-prewellordering]]。量化的候选 $P$ 是 $\\omega$ 的子集，$R,S$ 是 $\\omega$ 上的二元关系；不假定 $\\Gamma$ 单调。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-inductive-norm]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-inductive-norm]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-inductive-norm|18-df-inductive-norm]]"}],"outgoing":["1617e481ba305017"]}